#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Racers: unflagged cold boot through all 3 DirectShow intro movies to
# rendered Main Menu and clean exit (#370, #372).
#
# Sequence:
# - Flips 0..236: `lmicmp.avi` (640x480 IV50 + 22050 Hz PCM, 237 frames,
#   unskippable) plays to completion (`EC_COMPLETE`).
# - Flips 237..241: `hvscmp.avi` (640x480 IV50 + 22050 Hz PCM, 337 frames,
#   skippable) starts and is skipped on flip 240..241 via Space (`WM_KEYUP`).
# - Flips 242..247: `introcmp.avi` (640x480 scalable IV50 + 22050 Hz PCM,
#   1080 frames, skippable) starts and is skipped on flip 246..247 via left
#   mouse click (`click_in_a_movie` -> Space `WM_KEYUP`).
# - Flips 247..546: LEGO Media splash screen fades in, holds, and fades out
#   while Main Menu assets and 3D minifigure models load.
# - Flips 547..580: animated 3D Captain Redbeard Main Menu (640x480x16) with
#   software cursor `ARROW.BMP` initially at (0, 0).
# - Flip 580: closes cleanly (`WM_SYSCOMMAND SC_CLOSE` -> `timeKillEvent` ->
#   `DestroyWindow` -> `PostQuitMessage(0)` -> exit 0).
flip 240 key Space down
flip 241 key Space up
flip 245 move 320 240
flip 246 down left
flip 247 up left
flip 580 close
